# TabDock process

1. Any product, code, or behavior change must be recorded in `CHANGELOG.md`.
2. After making changes, commit and push to `origin/main` immediately, unless the user says otherwise.

Do not rewrite `PRODUCT.md` to match an implementation. Follow `DEVELOPMENT.md`.
